AltoRewardsDistributor::setPaymentToken
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when oracle is not zero address
    │   ├── it should set payment token configuration
    │   ├── it should cache token decimals
    │   └── it should emit SetPaymentToken event
    ├── when oracle is zero address
    │   ├── it should delete payment token configuration
    │   └── it should emit SetPaymentToken event
    └── when token decimals call fails
        └── it should revert
